// trimmed for the wire) over generated days and workouts; no household figures. `satisfies` makes the compiler hold
// each one to the wire type.
//
// The recipe, so the capture can be repeated: a throwaway server test (deleted after the capture) on the harness
// of apps/server/test/harness.ts with its clock at 2026-09-10T10:00:00Z (today 2026-09-10 for p1, Europe/Amsterdam),
// one source 'watch', and merged daily rows, coverage 1, for every date from 2025-01-01 to 2026-08-31, with n the
// days since 2025-01-01, k = (37 * (n + 1)) % 61, and no row at all on a date where n % 11 === 10:
//   steps 5000 + 100k; active_minutes_light 150 + k, _moderate 20 + k % 15, _vigorous 5 + k % 7 (sum)
//   distance (3500 + 60k) * 1000 mm; floors 6 + k % 9; active_energy 400 + 5k; total_calories 2200 + 5k
//   workout_minutes 20 + k % 30; altitude_gain (10 + k % 20) * 1000 mm; sedentary_minutes 600 + 2k
