//   time_in_heart_rate_zone_light_minutes 200 + k, _moderate 30 + k % 20, _vigorous 8 + k % 6, _peak k % 4
//   cardio_load_edwards 40 + k                            (all sum)
//   heart_rate (max) 150 + k % 30
//   daily_vo2_max (last): 40 on 2026-05-10 and 42.5 on 2026-08-18, 100 days apart, so the trend is 'rising'
// Exercise sessions from 'watch': one every fourth day from 2025-01-02 to 2026-07-31, then ten in August 2026 on
