// BIKING by j; active duration 1500 + 60 * (j % 7) seconds, distance (3000 + 200 * (j % 9)) m, calories
// 200 + 10 * (j % 8), average heart rate 120 + 5 * (j % 5), pace (active duration / distance) s/m, and on a run a
// climb of (10 + 5 * (j % 6)) m. j counts each series from 0: the earlier sessions from 2025-01-02, August's from
// 2026-08-02. Each starts at 05:30Z and ends its active duration later; the VO2 max rows ignore the n % 11 gap.
// MONTH is range=month&anchor=2026-08-15 (twelve earlier months to judge against, nine counted workouts across three
// types plus the excluded one listed); YEAR is range=year&anchor=2025-06-01 (no 2024, so every usual is thin);
